      "chart_spread_gain": "New country markets on tracked chart lists or Shazam charts. It ranks signal lists first and never joins the two-family score, because it overlaps playlists and Shazam.",
      "cluster_key": "Provisional movement group key. Open member_song_keys to inspect the strict keys.",
      "component": "Existing movement component that supplies value and evidence.",
      "day": "Bound daily cycle day in UTC.",
      "evidence": "Source row locators and their captured input builds. cluster_confidence is measured precision, the lowest merge-rule Wilson 95% lower bound; open the cluster audit.",
      "family": "Independent family; playlists, shazam or streams.",
      "last_entered_at": "Most recent qualifying entry observation.",
