      "member_song_keys": "Sorted JSON array of strict keys scored together. Open evidence for merge methods.",
      "movement_list": "new_entries: new songs by emerging, developing or unknown-stage artists. established_entries: new songs by established artists. catalog_entries: catalog waking up. unplaced: unknown age and no new-music list in the window, so no movement view reads it. Lists never mix.",
